  lines:
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: kang buburnya satu.
    pfp: {fileID: 1102108819684225473, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kang Bubur
    text: 'oke siapp..

'
    pfp: {fileID: -196245138857305096, guid: 5e8a76ca080ed87499fed384410965f5, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kang Bubur
    text: 'kalian bukan orang sini kan?

'
    pfp: {fileID: -196245138857305096, guid: 5e8a76ca080ed87499fed384410965f5, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: 'iya kang, kenapa ya?

'
    pfp: {fileID: -1558504309130386734, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kang Bubur
    text: 'walah udah jarang banget ada berkunjung ke desa ini, ga biasa aja

'
    pfp: {fileID: 7839481559900228051, guid: f4ada3c2e0869674fa430a17d1dd9e12, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kang Bubur
    text: kalo ada aki aki nyamperin kalian dan bilang yang enggak-enggak cuekin
      aja ya
    pfp: {fileID: 7839481559900228051, guid: f4ada3c2e0869674fa430a17d1dd9e12, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Kang Bubur
    text: mbah wongso itu emang agak kurang dia setelah ditinggal anaknya
    pfp: {fileID: -196245138857305096, guid: 5e8a76ca080ed87499fed384410965f5, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Ryan
    text: Oh, iya kang.
    pfp: {fileID: 8660902975792385251, guid: 717fe866f10db74429e9a9133c64ab34, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: 0}
